    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0143" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg23"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Collier to the Acting Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-07-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 3, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt, at 11.40 p.m. on the 1st instant, of your cable, reading: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Secretary Hay died unexpectedly at twelve twenty-five this morning.
                            Notify government and display usual symbols of mourning.”</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">“<hi rendition="#small-caps">Peirce.</hi>”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0144" n="24" xml:id="pg24"/>
                <p>I immediately dispatched a note to the Spanish minister or state, conveying to
                    him the sad intelligence of Secretary Hay’s death, and I instructed the janitor
                    to half-mast the flag of the legation and to display the usual symbols of
                    mourning.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have received from the minister of state a letter, copy and translation of
                    which I inclose.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Miller
                    Collier.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d61-a1.xml" xpointer="d61-a1"/>
            </div>
